          "kicker": "SCORING TRENDS",
          "heading": "Fiji scoring average drops following three consecutive Nations Championship defeats",
          "body": "Fiji have averaged 28.5 points scored and 31.9 points conceded per game across their last 11 senior men’s internationals. This scoring rate has declined during the current campaign; the side has averaged just over 16 points per match across their three recent losses. In the broader 11-game window, the team’s most significant result remains the 63-10 win against Canada recorded in September 2025. Fiji currently sit bottom of the table following their 17-33 defeat to Scotland."
