          "kicker": "Law alignment",
          "heading": "Premiership clubs agree law interpretation overhaul to aid Steve Borthwick's England",
          "body": "Premiership directors of rugby have agreed to align domestic refereeing with the international game to support Steve Borthwick’s World Cup preparations. Following a meeting with Borthwick, officials will now prioritise stricter policing of the offside line, the breakdown, and the scrum’s brake-foot law. The revamp aims to address inconsistencies that hindered England during the Six Nations and better prepare the squad for the ferocity of Test rugby ahead of next year’s tournament in Australia."
