          "heading": "World Rugby continues talks regarding moving a Six Nations match abroad",
          "body": "World Rugby remains in active discussions regarding plans to host a Six Nations fixture in the United States to grow the sport's global footprint. While the proposal continues to spark debate, no specific venue or team matchups have been finalised. Reports from last week indicated that England are unlikely to participate in such a move, leaving the status of any potential French involvement or specific scheduling unresolved as negotiations between stakeholders continue."
