          "heading": "Italy Men Face World Champion South Africa At Allianz Stadium Venue",
          "body": "Top-level international rugby is set to return to the Allianz Stadium this November. Following the official presentation held on Sunday, 20 September, it was confirmed that Italy will host reigning world champions South Africa at the home of Juventus. This fixture marks the Azzurri’s first home match of the 2026 Nations Championship. Gonzalo Quesada’s side will utilise the Turin venue to kick off a demanding autumn series before continuing their campaign with further tests in Genoa and Udine."
