          "body": "Wales head coach Sean Lynn has confirmed that scrum-half Seren Lockwood will miss Saturday's WXV Global Series fixture against the USA at Cardiff Arms Park. Lockwood, named Wales women's young player of the year, is currently progressing through World Rugby's return to play protocols following a head injury assessment. Her absence sees Lleucu George return to the starting lineup at 10, with Keira Bevan shifting to her familiar role at nine for the encounter against the visitors."
